      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As someone who tinkers with avatars and such, I think it's worth pointing out two things.\n\nA) if you're asking about loading Android content on PC, actually doing that would be very laggy, if they got it to work.\n\nB) nothing stops users from uploading lite content. For avatars I have a 10k polygon version that uses one material on both quest and PC.",
