      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} Maybe a better way to word this suggestion is to have a UI Enabled way to mimic the Quest Standards / Version of worlds to enforce performance that is guaranteed to work on Quest. Even where there are worlds that have versions for both they're not always equal in minimal performance even if they give you an option to turn some settings off.",
